From a673b7fbd304715e523370007142d41a9ca9d2b6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Angelpro09xd <167892325+Angelpro09xd@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 01:13:26 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] dsp: spf-core: match sapphire close-all timeout (1000 ms)

The stock sapphire spf_core_dlkm.ko waits 250 jiffies (HZ=250, 1 s) for
the APM close-all response instead of the CLO default of 5 s. Everything
else in spf_core (and in gpr, q6_notifier, q6_pdr, snd_event and
adsp_loader) already matches stock function by function.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 dsp/spf-core.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/dsp/spf-core.c b/dsp/spf-core.c
index 17c190b..7241fa0 100644
--- a/dsp/spf-core.c
+++ b/dsp/spf-core.c
@@ -26,7 +26,7 @@
 
 #define APM_STATE_READY_TIMEOUT_MS    10000
 #define Q6_READY_TIMEOUT_MS 1000
-#define Q6_CLOSE_ALL_TIMEOUT_MS 5000
+#define Q6_CLOSE_ALL_TIMEOUT_MS 1000
 #define APM_CMD_GET_SPF_STATE 0x01001021
 #define APM_CMD_CLOSE_ALL 0x01001013
 #define APM_CMD_RSP_GET_SPF_STATE 0x02001007
-- 
2.53.0

